  "draft_py": "# Chandra's Flame Wave\n# s1 \"Chandra's Flame Wave deals 2 damage to target player and each creature that player controls.\"\n#    The designated player is TARGET_PLAYER (Mind Rot); the query synthesizes the one player slot\n#    and both atoms read its binding. Player-zone ALL selector as Storm Caller; \"that player\n#    controls\" as CONTROLLER_IS TARGET_PLAYER.\n# s2+s3 \"Search your library and/or graveyard for a card named Chandra, Flame's Fury, reveal it, and put\n#    it into your hand. If you search your library this way, shuffle.\" Basri's Aegis tree (both zones,\n#    library only, graveyard only; SHUFFLE only where the library is searched), mandatory: no OptionalEffect.\ndamage = Seq(steps=(\n    A(Verb.DEAL_DAMAGE, {\n        'amount': QConst(value=2),\n        'target': Selector(\n            count=QUnbounded(),\n            mode=SelectorMode.ALL,\n            filter=FAnd(children=()),\n            zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.PLAYER, controller=ControllerRef.TARGET_PLAYER),),\n        ),\n    }),\n    A(Verb.DEAL_DAMAGE, {\n        'amount': QConst(value=2),\n        'target': Selector(\n            count=QUnbounded(),\n            mode=SelectorMode.ALL,\n            filter=FAnd(children=(\n                FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.CONTROLLER_IS, who=ControllerRef.TARGET_PLAYER),\n                FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n            )),\n            zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n        ),\n    }),\n))\nname = FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.NAME_EQ, string_value=\"Chandra, Flame's Fury\")\ngy = Zone(kind=ZoneKind.GRAVEYARD, controller=ControllerRef.YOU)\nlib = Zone(kind=ZoneKind.LIBRARY, controller=ControllerRef.YOU)\nhand = Zone(kind=ZoneKind.HAND, controller=ControllerRef.YOU)\ndef search(zones):\n    return A(Verb.SEARCH, {\n        'cards': Selector(count=QConst(value=1), mode=SelectorMode.ONE_OF, filter=name, zones=zones),\n        'destination': hand,\n    })\nreveal = A(Verb.REVEAL, {'controller': ControllerRef.YOU, 'count': QConst(value=1)})\nshuffle = A(Verb.SHUFFLE, {'zone': lib})\ntutor = Choose(\n    count=QConst(value=1),\n    options=(\n        Seq(steps=(search((gy, lib)), reveal, shuffle)),\n        Seq(steps=(search((lib,)), reveal, shuffle)),\n        Seq(steps=(search((gy,)), reveal)),\n    ),\n)\nabilities = [SpellAbility(kind=SpellKind.SORCERY, effect=Seq(steps=(damage, tutor)))]\n",
